    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/aa/Screenshot_20240622_090355_Chrome.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240622143221\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 20240622 090355 Chrome\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/aa/Screenshot_20240622_090355_Chrome.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240622143221\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1004\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Screenshot 20240622 090355 Chrome.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Screenshot_20240622_090355_Chrome.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>英勇武士大师</b>\n</p><p><b>森·德川</b>  是来自系列的角色。\n\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyakka_Ry%C5%8Dran_Samurai_Girls\">百花缭乱：武士女孩</a>\n</p><p><b>柳生宗明</b>的童年好友，德川幕府的长女。她似乎对宗明有感情，对他表现得非常像傲娇。她自称被宠坏的公主，总想在任何决定上随心所欲。她对任何试图接近宗明的女孩都非常嫉妒，通常以暴怒来表现这种嫉妒，例如当  <a href=\"/wiki/Akane_%27Jubei%27_Yagyu\" title=\"Akane &#39;Jubei&#39; Yagyu\">柳生十兵卫</a>  在她面前亲吻他，之后她让他戴上完整的鬼面具，以便他能「反思」他与……分享的吻  <a href=\"/wiki/Yukimura_Sanada\" title=\"Yukimura Sanada\">真田幸村</a>。后来，她向宗明表露真心并吻了他，从而成为他的第三位大师武士。她的武器是柄装饰有刀锋的薙刀，她的变身口号是「Tenga Ryūrei」意为「优雅之美」，武士大师徽章是「优雅」。\n\n</p><p>在第二季中，她可以随意变身成大师武士，无需口号。Sen的攻击通常涉及雷或闪电。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/b8/Tokugawa_Sen_Daring_Master_Samurai_Bride_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250320030630\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tokugawa Sen Daring Master Samurai Bride Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/b8/Tokugawa_Sen_Daring_Master_Samurai_Bride_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250320030630\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1016\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Tokugawa Sen Daring Master Samurai Bride Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Tokugawa_Sen_Daring_Master_Samurai_Bride_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/16/Sen_Tokugawa_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240622143425\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sen Tokugawa S QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran Samurai Bride \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/16/Sen_Tokugawa_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240622143425\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1017\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Sen Tokugawa S QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran Samurai Bride .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Sen_Tokugawa_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820194058\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39720-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820194058 and revision id 64426. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
